OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to again consider extra
OL,4,Atax on empty homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council is set to look again
OL,7,Fat bringing in an extra tax on empty
OL,8,Fproperties and second homes.
OL,10,FIf approved, homeowners in Derby would
OL,11,Fpay a 100% council tax premium on
OL,12,Fproperties that have been "unoccupied
OL,13,Fand substantially unfurnished" for at
OL,14,Fleast one year from April 2027.
OL,16,FThe same premium for second homes would
OL,17,Fcome into effect the following year.
OL,19,FCouncillor Shiraz Khan, cabinet member
OL,20,Ffor housing, said the measures were to
OL,21,F"encourage property owners to live in
OL,22,For sell" their empty homes.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
